    "bodySample": "‹‹ SALES ▾ FUNDING ▾ CLIENT OPS ▾ WATCH ▾ AUTOMATION ▾ MARKETING ▾ ◇ Campaigns BETA ◉ Social Studio BETA ✳ Creative Factory BETA ▶ Content BETA ADMIN ▾ PORTALS ▾ fundhub Beta — under development. Data may be incomplete or inaccurate. Do not use for client decisions. Dismiss MARKETING Creative Factory NO PARTNER SELECTED READ-ONLY · GET SHOW REQUEST URLS No partner selected. Open this screen with ?partner_id= set to one partner and this fills with that partner’s rows. CF-01 / PARTNER SCOPE STAFF · NAMED PARTNER PARTNER No partner selected partner_id = not set Nothing is loaded yet. Generation jobs, the creative library, the review queue and brand kits appear here once this screen is opened for one partner — add ?partner_id=<id> to this page’s address and reload. Until then no request is sent and the buttons below are switched off, because a stand-in id would read and write against a partner that does not exist. This screen only ever shows one partner at a time. There is no roll-up, no leaderboard and no partner-vs-partner view. CF-02 / GENERATION JOBS STATE ALL QUEUED RUNNING SUCCEEDED FAILED LIMIT 5 10 25 50 200 JOB STATUS ASSET KIND FORMATS VARIANTS ATTEMPT ASSETS PROVIDER CREATED FINISHED No partner selected. Open this screen with ?partner_id= set to one partner and this fills with that partner’s rows. ‹ PREV NEXT › count 0 · limit 10 · offset 0 · hasMore false no total — hasMore comes from selecting limit+1 rows Newest first, always. These columns cannot be sorted or searched, and there is no cost per job — that figure is not sent to this screen, so it is not shown. CF-03 / JOB STATES & RETRY FOUR STATUSES, EXHAUSTIVE No partner selected. Open this screen with ?partner_id= set to one partner and this fills with that partner’s rows. A job is tried up to three times before it is marked failed. \"Attempt\" counts those tries, not tries left. There is no progress bar, no time estimate and no queue position. CF-04 / CREATIVE LIBRARY NOT READ STATE A